"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunktia_handbook=globalThis.webpackChunktia_handbook||[]).push([[173],{9409:n=>{n.exports=JSON.parse('{"name":"TIA-LLM","fullName":"TIA-PARTNERS-GROUP/TIA-LLM","description":null,"url":"https://github.com/TIA-PARTNERS-GROUP/TIA-LLM","cloneUrl":"https://github.com/TIA-PARTNERS-GROUP/TIA-LLM.git","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"lastUpdated":"2025-10-23T14:26:52Z","archived":false,"content":"# TIA-LLM\\n\\nTIA-LLM is an AI-powered chatbot system built with FastAPI and Google ADK for managing conversations, agent switching, and session handling.\\n\\n## Setup\\n\\n1. **Clone the repository** (if not already done):\\n   ```\\n   git clone <repository-url>\\n   cd tia_connect/TIA-LLM\\n   ```\\n\\n2. **Create a virtual environment**:\\n   ```\\n   python -m venv .venv\\n   ```\\n\\n3. **Activate the virtual environment**:\\n   - On Windows:\\n     ```\\n     .venv\\\\Scripts\\\\activate\\n     ```\\n   - On macOS/Linux:\\n     ```\\n     source .venv/bin/activate\\n     ```\\n\\n4. **Install dependencies**:\\n   ```\\n   pip install -r requirements.txt\\n   ```\\n\\n5. **Set up environment variables**:\\n   - Create a `.env` file in the root directory with necessary variables (e.g., database credentials, API keys).\\n   - Example:\\n     ```\\n     DB_USER=your_db_user\\n     DB_PASS=your_db_password\\n     DB_HOST=localhost\\n     DB_NAME=tiapartners\\n     DB_PORT=3333\\n     OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_key\\n     ```\\n\\n## How to Launch\\n\\nTo run the application, use the following command (as noted in `main.py`):\\n\\n```\\nuvicorn TIA_Smart_chat_v3.main:app --reload --port 8080\\n```\\n\\n- `--reload`: Enables auto-reload on code changes (useful for development).\\n- `--port 8080`: Runs the server on port 8080.\\n\\nThe API will be available at `http://localhost:8080`.\\n\\n### Endpoints\\n\\n- `POST /chat/tia-chat`: Send a message to the chatbot.\\n- `POST /chat/reset-session`: Reset a user session.\\n- `POST /chat/test-eval`: Run evaluation tests.\\n\\n## Additional Notes\\n\\n- Ensure your database is set up and running (MySQL in this case).\\n- The app uses Google ADK for agent management and session persistence.","path":"README.md"}')}}]);